# GRUB SHIFT: BOOST lets the straight tools reach all the way and in all 8
# directions for the rest of the shift. BLINK can land on sour pods (and
# pays for it). HAIL hits every planter, Tilly's own too if she stands on one.
game grubshift
wait 5
cheat contract 1 7
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 0
cheat chip 6 30
cheat use 6 0 0
expect fx & 2
cheat bug 4 4 1 0
cheat use 5 4 4
expect kills == 1
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 0
cheat energy 3
cheat sour 5 4 1
cheat chip 3 7
cheat use 3 5 4
expect px == 5
expect py == 4
expect energy == 2
cheat clear
cheat tilly 2 2
cheat elev 2 2 1
cheat elev 4 4 1
cheat bug 4 4 1 0
cheat chip 4 21
cheat use 4 2 2
expect kills == 2
expect status == 2
